{
  "text": "The AirSip is a portable, battery-powered device that filters and purifies ambient air in real time. Designed for urban environments, it removes pollutants like PM2.5, pollen, and volatile organic compounds. The unit features a compact, ergonomic shape with a built-in fan and replaceable multi-stage filters. It connects to a smartphone app to display real-time air quality data and filter life. Ideal for commuters, allergy sufferers, and outdoor workers, the AirSip delivers clean, breathable air on demand. It operates quietly and lasts up to 8 hours on a single charge. The device is lightweight, easy to carry, and requires no external power source. AirSip enhances personal air quality in polluted areas without relying on fixed infrastructure."
}
